Description: Kavis look and feel — GTK theme, icons, cursors, wallpapers
 The visual files carrying Kavis' identity:
 .
  * GTK3 theme (light and dark), GTK2 compatibility and Openbox window theme
  * Icon theme derived from the K logo (inherits Papirus-Dark + Adwaita)
  * XCursor cursor theme with teal accent
  * Wallpapers in the brand colors
  * Distribution identity in /etc/os-release
 .
 Colors: teal #2DD4BF, blue #4F92F7, ground #0D141B, text #E6EDF3.
 The default look is dark; the light theme is the second option.
